                                "sense_id": "0c394b9a-b0b6-38ba-bbaa-972e2ffe80e9",
                                "text": "This is a steaming underworld:\nWhere are the writhings? Where the cries?\nWe came down from our overworld\nTo see them writhe, to hear their cries."
